<title>NEW ZEALAND: Parapine has option to buy into Promall.</title>
<headline>Parapine has option to buy into Promall.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parapine Timber Ltd said on Tuesday it had acquired an an option to purchase 25 percent of the ordinary capital of shopping centre development company Promall Limited.</p>
</text>
